          <div class="ewpl-mech__head">
            <div class="ewpl-mech__icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#47B5E9" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.5C8.5 7 5.5 10.3 5.5 14a6.5 6.5 0 0 0 13 0c0-3.7-3-7-6.5-11.5Zm0 16.5a4 4 0 0 1-4-4c0-.4.06-.8.17-1.2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 12 15.5c1.5 0 2.9-.6 3.9-1.6.07.35.1.72.1 1.1a4 4 0 0 1-4 4Z"/></svg></div>
            <div class="ewpl-mech__name">Aloe + chamomile stop regrowth</div>
          </div>
          <p class="ewpl-mech__copy">Gentle antibacterial ingredients keep it from coming back between wipes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ewpl-mech__card">
          <div class="ewpl-mech__media"><img src="{{ 'ewpl-mech-apply.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="An EyeWipes pad being wiped gently around a calm dog's eye" width="700" height="524" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="ewpl-mech__head">
            <div class="ewpl-mech__icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#47B5E9" stroke-width="2.2"/><path d="M12 7v5.2l3.4 2" stroke="#47B5E9" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
            <div class="ewpl-mech__name">30 seconds, no struggle</div>
          </div>
          <p class="ewpl-mech__copy">Soft, rounded, and gentle enough for daily use — even on sensitive dogs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a class="ewpl-skip" href="{{ offer_anchor }}">Skip to offer ↓</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="ewpl-wave" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 1440 64" preserveAspectRatio="none" focusable="false"><path d="M0 28 C240 56 480 8 720 32 C960 56 1200 12 1440 36 L1440 0 L0 0 Z" fill="#D5F7FF"/></svg></div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- 5. what to expect ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="ewpl-expect" aria-labelledby="ewpl-expect-title">
    <div class="ewpl-expect__inner">
      <h2 class="ewpl-h2 ewpl-expect__title" id="ewpl-expect-title">What to <span class="ewpl-accent">expect</span></h2>
      <div class="ewpl-tl">
        <div class="ewpl-tl__line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="ewpl-tl__item">
          <div class="ewpl-tl__avatar ewpl-tl__avatar--1"><img src="{{ 'ewpl-week-1.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Week 1 — a Maltese with hard crust and a red, irritated eye area" width="420" height="420" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="ewpl-tl__copy">
            <div class="ewpl-tl__chip">Week 1</div>
            <p class="ewpl-tl__text">Less gunk waiting for you each morning.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ewpl-tl__item">
          <div class="ewpl-tl__avatar ewpl-tl__avatar--2"><img src="{{ 'ewpl-week-2.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Week 2 — the same Maltese with less crust, some staining still visible" width="420" height="420" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="ewpl-tl__copy">
            <div class="ewpl-tl__chip">Week 2</div>
            <p class="ewpl-tl__text">Discharge slows down. The fur around the eyes starts to brighten.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ewpl-tl__item">
          <div class="ewpl-tl__avatar ewpl-tl__avatar--3"><img src="{{ 'ewpl-week-3.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Week 3 — the same Maltese with a completely clear, bright eye area" width="420" height="420" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="ewpl-tl__copy">
            <div class="ewpl-tl__chip">Week 3</div>
            <p class="ewpl-tl__text">Clean, bright, comfortable — she leans into your hand instead of bracing for it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a class="ewpl-skip" href="{{ offer_anchor }}">Skip to offer ↓</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- 6. comparison ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="ewpl-cmp" aria-labelledby="ewpl-cmp-title">
    <div class="ewpl-cmp__inner">
      <h2 class="ewpl-h2 ewpl-cmp__title" id="ewpl-cmp-title"><span class="ewpl-accent">EyeWipes</span> vs. what you've already tried</h2>

      <div class="ewpl-cmp__desktop">
        <div class="ewpl-cmp__row">
          <div></div>
          <div class="ewpl-cmp__hero-col">
            <img class="ewpl-cmp__hero-img" src="{{ 'ewpl-packshot.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="EyeWipes" width="500" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <div class="ewpl-cmp__hero-name">EyeWipes</div>
          </div>
          {%- for rival in cmp_rivals -%}
            {%- assign r = rival | split: '~' -%}
            <div class="ewpl-cmp__col">
              <img src="{{ r[1] | asset_url }}" alt="{{ r[2] }}" width="260" height="260" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              <div class="ewpl-cmp__col-name">{{ r[0] }}</div>
            </div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        {%- for row in cmp_rows -%}
          {%- assign c = row | split: '~' -%}
          <div class="ewpl-cmp__row">
            <div class="ewpl-cmp__label">{{ c[0] }}</div>
            <div class="ewpl-cmp__cell-win">{% render 'ewpl-mark', code: c[1], winner: true %}</div>
            <div class="ewpl-cmp__cell">{% render 'ewpl-mark', code: c[2] %}</div>
            <div class="ewpl-cmp__cell">{% render 'ewpl-mark', code: c[3] %}</div>
            <div class="ewpl-cmp__cell">{% render 'ewpl-mark', code: c[4] %}</div>
            <div class="ewpl-cmp__cell">{% render 'ewpl-mark', code: c[5] %}</div>
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>

      <div class="ewpl-cmp__mobile">
        <div class="ewpl-cmp__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Compare EyeWipes with">
          {%- for rival in cmp_rivals -%}
            {%- assign r = rival | split: '~' -%}
            {%- assign idx = forloop.index -%}
            <button
              type="button"
              class="ewpl-cmp__tab"
              role="tab"
              id="ewpl-cmp-tab-{{ idx }}"
              aria-controls="ewpl-cmp-panel-{{ idx }}"
              aria-selected="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
              tabindex="{% if forloop.first %}0{% else %}-1{% endif %}">{{ r[0] }}</button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        {%- for rival in cmp_rivals -%}
          {%- assign r = rival | split: '~' -%}
          {%- assign idx = forloop.index -%}
          {%- assign col = forloop.index | plus: 1 -%}
          <div
            class="ewpl-cmp__panel"
            role="tabpanel"
            id="ewpl-cmp-panel-{{ idx }}"
            aria-labelledby="ewpl-cmp-tab-{{ idx }}"
            {% unless forloop.first %}hidden{% endunless %}>
            <div class="ewpl-cmp__mhead">
              <div class="ewpl-cmp__mhead-title">Compare</div>
              <div class="ewpl-cmp__mcol">
                <img src="{{ 'ewpl-packshot.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="EyeWipes" width="500" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
                <div class="ewpl-cmp__mcol-name">EyeWipes</div>
              </div>
              <div class="ewpl-cmp__mcol">
                <img class="ewpl-cmp__mrival-img" src="{{ r[1] | asset_url }}" alt="{{ r[2] }}" width="260" height="260" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
                <div class="ewpl-cmp__mrival-name">{{ r[0] }}</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            {%- for row in cmp_rows -%}
              {%- assign c = row | split: '~' -%}
              <div class="ewpl-cmp__mrow">
                <div class="ewpl-cmp__mlabel">{{ c[0] }}</div>
                <div class="ewpl-cmp__mcell-win">{% render 'ewpl-mark', code: c[1], winner: true %}</div>
                <div class="ewpl-cmp__mcell">{% render 'ewpl-mark', code: c[col] %}</div>
              </div>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>

      <a class="ewpl-skip" href="{{ offer_anchor }}">Skip to offer ↓</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="ewpl-wave" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 1440 64" preserveAspectRatio="none" focusable="false"><path d="M0 40 C240 8 480 64 720 40 C960 16 1200 56 1440 28 L1440 64 L0 64 Z" fill="#D5F7FF"/></svg></div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- 7. reviews ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="ewpl-reviews" aria-labelledby="ewpl-reviews-title">
    <div class="ewpl-reviews__inner">
      <h2 class="ewpl-h2 ewpl-reviews__title" id="ewpl-reviews-title">45,000+ dog owners finally found <span class="ewpl-accent">a routine that works</span></h2>
